!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! Mitigacion de DHCP Starvation (DHCP Snooping + rate limit)
en
conf term
!!!! Habilitar DHCP Snooping globalmente
ip dhcp snooping

!!!! Aplicar a VLAN1
ip dhcp snooping vlan 1

!!!! Puerto legitimo = trusted
interface GigabitEthernet0/0
ip dhcp snooping trust
exit

!!!! Puerto atacante = limitar a 10 paquetes/seg
!!!! Esto evita que agote el pool de IPs
interface GigabitEthernet0/1
ip dhcp snooping limit rate 10
exit
do wr
